│ The context suggests this happens because the function doesn’t     │
│ explicitly check the input type and simply converts it. The fix    │
│ involves adding a type check to ensure the input is iterable and,  │
│ if so, preserving the iterable type.                               │
│                                                                    │
│ Here’s the patch:                                                  │
│                                                                    │
│ ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ │
